### Asks the shipment assistant a question. Needs GROQ_API_KEY set on the backend;
### without it the answer is 503 with a message saying so.
### The backend keeps no conversation: send earlier turns in "messages" to follow up.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "Which 3 shipments lost the most, and why?" }
  ]
}
